insert into public.content_blocks (content_id, lang, block_key, position, block_type, style, body) select id, 'en', 'p1', 1, 'paragraph', 'verified_fact', $t$According to the {{term:census}} of 2011, Assam has 3,12,05,576 people, with a {{term:population-density|density}} of 398 per sq km, a {{term:sex-ratio|sex ratio}} of 958 and a {{term:literacy-rate|literacy rate}} of 72.19%. About 86 percent of people live in villages.$t$ from public.content where slug = $t$population-census-2011$t$ on conflict do nothing;
